#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0252-A expect=skipped domain=ADAE
#note "A conformant OCCDS dataset carrying NEITHER AVALCA<y>N NOR BASECA<y>N: no column name matches ^AVALCA\\d+N$ or ^BASECA\\d+N$ (ASEVN and AEDECOD do not). Nothing seeds an expansion, WildcardExpander returns NoMatch and the rule does not execute. This is the rule's negative control: it has NO noViolation state, because an expansion only exists when one of the two columns matched, and that same match makes the disjunction true. So the outcome is either 1 violation per matched index, or SKIPPED."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADAE structure=OCCDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AEDECOD type=Char
col ASEV    type=Char
col ASEVN   type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE | MILD | 1
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | NAUSEA | MODERATE | 2
